WEBVTT

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:07.250
The date is 1969.

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:10.810
The setting is Japan in a period
of advanced economic growth.

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:14.370
This is the story of those who protect
mankind from the grasp of invaders.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.670
This is the story
of The Gate Keepers.

00:00:31.470 --> 00:00:36.000
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:46.180
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:48.780
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:49.450 --> 00:00:52.320
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:54.320
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.730
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:59.290
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.900
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:07.600
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:01:07.970 --> 00:01:11.370
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:14.040
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:01:15.610 --> 00:01:18.750
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:21.010
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:25.390
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:29.150
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:29.530 --> 00:01:32.290
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:32.290 --> 00:01:36.230
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:36.230 --> 00:01:39.030
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:41.270
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:45.570
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:46.140 --> 00:01:52.100
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:02:24.300 --> 00:02:25.930
It's here!

00:02:32.910 --> 00:02:36.340
July 24, 1969, the mid-Pacific.
Apollo 11 returns home.

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:39.180
First an industrial
complex, then Apollo.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:42.250
The invaders' targets are
changing all the time.

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:46.730
Maybe, but Ukiya and I will
easily beat the invaders.

00:02:47.300 --> 00:02:49.330
Right, Ukiya? Huh?

00:02:56.010 --> 00:02:57.340
What's wrong?

00:02:57.410 --> 00:02:59.850
Mankind is amazing, don't you think?

00:02:59.910 --> 00:03:01.280
What?

00:03:01.350 --> 00:03:04.510
We can send people to the moon.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:08.550
Man mustn't give up.

00:03:09.020 --> 00:03:12.930
With the power to believe,
anything can be made possible.

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:15.860
Any dream can be made a reality.

00:03:15.930 --> 00:03:18.060
Your father used to say...

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.530
I'm sorry.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:23.970
He was always all talk, no action.

00:03:29.880 --> 00:03:34.010
<i>For all his big talk,
he was the first to give up!</i>

00:03:36.920 --> 00:03:41.250
Ayaya! It's too bad we have to
return right away after battle.

00:03:41.320 --> 00:03:45.380
Since we were going to the South
Pacific, I brought my swimsuit.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:49.290
Oh, my. I brought mine, too.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:53.820
Gaudy swimsuits... The peacock feathers
pagen women don to attract men.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:01.340
What's wrong?!

00:04:01.410 --> 00:04:04.210
We're in trouble!
We're out of control!!

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:05.880
What?!

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:09.910
<i>I am Akuma Hakushaku</i>

00:04:09.980 --> 00:04:13.540
You are so fortunate
to have met me.

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.280
Akuma Hakushaku?!

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:16.450
An invader?!

00:04:17.490 --> 00:04:21.450
I present you all with a
special invitation to Hell.

00:04:40.530 --> 00:04:42.000
Akuma Hakushaku!

00:04:44.670 --> 00:04:46.530
Please don't make
any sudden moves.

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:51.770
You're finally awake.
How do you feel, Captain Ukiya?

00:04:52.740 --> 00:04:54.540
Ms. Ochiai?!

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:58.510
When we're in private,
call me Keiko.

00:04:58.580 --> 00:04:59.570
In private?

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:02.550
That's right. After
the rescue of Apollo...

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:05.920
...the commander gave us six
hours of free time, remember?

00:05:07.220 --> 00:05:08.780
He did?

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:11.820
<i>This isn't Hell at all.</i>

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:16.000
<i>This is just like Heaven.</i>

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:19.660
What are you staring at?!

00:05:25.310 --> 00:05:27.040
Y- You're all...

00:05:27.710 --> 00:05:30.440
Come on, don't sit there, Ukiya!

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:32.480
Come and play with us!

00:05:34.120 --> 00:05:35.590
Come on, hurry.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:40.090
Rurippe... that swimsuit
is incredibly...

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.060
Huh?

00:05:42.330 --> 00:05:44.730
It's incredibly...

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.420
...grotesque.

00:05:48.930 --> 00:05:50.700
Humph! I never!

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:57.270
They've all fallen victim
to my mental attack.

00:05:58.240 --> 00:06:00.300
This is your so-called Hell?

00:06:00.980 --> 00:06:04.910
Don't be too quick to judge.
You, too, are a mere human.

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:07.420
You only trust what
you see with your eyes.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.680
I'm not like them. I'm
nothing like those maggots...

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:13.220
...who lack the simple
determination to kill.

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:16.120
I'll let you believe that, for now.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:22.290
I wonder what Ukiya
thought of my swimsuit?

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:25.390
It may not seem that way, but I
tried really hard to impress him.

00:06:25.470 --> 00:06:27.100
I can see that.

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:30.640
Ukiya!

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:34.340
You're always the only one I see.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:42.080
Kaoru, I have to tell
you that I've always...

00:06:52.860 --> 00:06:56.260
I'm going to pick that fruit
and give some to everybody.

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:58.360
I'm looking forward to that.

00:06:58.440 --> 00:06:59.900
What?!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:01.730
Oopsie-daisy!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.530
Ayaya. Captain!

00:07:04.440 --> 00:07:07.040
But I'd rather you didn't
give it to anyone else but me.

00:07:15.990 --> 00:07:17.250
Oh?

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.520
Are you awake, Sleeping Beauty?

00:07:21.020 --> 00:07:24.720
I love sea cucumber. Everyone
always hates the way it looks...

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.390
...but I alone
understand its attraction.

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.700
I also love sea cucumber.

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.170
Hmph, stupid Ukiya.

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:37.870
It wouldn't kill him to
compliment my swimsuit a little.

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:40.700
What did he mean, 'grotesque'?!

00:07:40.780 --> 00:07:42.400
I'm sorry about that, Rurippe.

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.410
Ukiya!

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:48.940
I keep telling you
not to call me Rurippe!

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:53.010
I actually wanted to
say that it's gorgeous.

00:07:53.090 --> 00:07:56.420
You've always been too
bright for me to gaze upon.

00:08:01.400 --> 00:08:02.870
W~ What?!

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.060
You're beautiful.

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:11.000
Human hearts are interesting toys!

00:08:11.070 --> 00:08:14.740
With just a touch of emotion,
they are so easily misled!

00:08:14.810 --> 00:08:18.180
I am amazed they have the gall to
call themselves rulers ofthe land.

00:08:18.880 --> 00:08:23.180
How can someone without a
heart talk about hearts? Idiotic.

00:08:24.420 --> 00:08:27.950
You yourself are the owner
of a weak heart, are you not?

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.350
I abandoned my heart.

00:08:31.430 --> 00:08:33.060
Oh, yes. I forgot.

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:40.160
Can you afford to laugh? I believe
someone still isn't under your spell.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:42.330
What?

00:08:43.470 --> 00:08:46.140
It's weird. Something is weird.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:51.740
This island is soft and fluffy,
as though I were in a dream world.

00:08:52.550 --> 00:08:55.310
Not only that, I can't
hear a single bird.

00:08:56.520 --> 00:08:58.150
What's wrong?

00:08:58.220 --> 00:08:59.710
Oh... Ms. Ochiai.

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:04.350
I was just thinking how quiet it
is here just as if no one was here.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:09.230
You're wrong about that.
Everyone is over by the beach.

00:09:09.730 --> 00:09:13.430
Huh? Come to think of it,
why are you here?

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.300
You weren't on board the YS-11.

00:09:17.510 --> 00:09:20.030
That doesn't matter. Let's go.

00:09:20.110 --> 00:09:21.580
Uh, sure.

00:09:27.850 --> 00:09:30.510
Captain! Over here! Over here!

00:09:31.090 --> 00:09:33.920
Come play with us!

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:37.290
Wait a minute. Somethings strange!

00:09:38.900 --> 00:09:42.830
Who cares about that?

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:45.600
Come on, Ukiya...

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:48.470
Come over here!

00:09:49.970 --> 00:09:51.910
Wait a minute...

00:09:51.980 --> 00:09:54.950
Bancho, Megane! Help me!!!

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:58.550
Bancho should be
the captain after all!

00:09:58.620 --> 00:10:02.070
That's right! Ukiya
is worse than Ukki-yah.

00:10:04.090 --> 00:10:06.080
That's right! That's right!

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:13.660
Megane, we're begging you!

00:10:13.730 --> 00:10:18.430
Please remodel us as
invincible cyborgs!

00:10:18.670 --> 00:10:20.140
R- Remodel?!

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:28.510
Remodeling is the
true spirit of man!

00:10:45.900 --> 00:10:47.360
Ukiya...

00:10:48.160 --> 00:10:51.530
What's wrong, Kaoru?
Do you want me to stop?

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:54.900
It's not a matter of
wanting you to stop...

00:10:54.970 --> 00:10:57.630
...we're still only in
high school, you know.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:10:59.570
So?

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:03.340
So... maybe we shouldn't be doing...

00:11:04.650 --> 00:11:07.050
...this sort of thing, should we?

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:12.750
Kaoru, you're the only one in the
Gate Keeper team I truly count on.

00:11:14.590 --> 00:11:17.490
The rest of them are always
using up all their arrows...

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:22.960
...flying off somewhere, whining
and moaning... They're all useless.

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:24.990
Ukiya...

00:11:31.470 --> 00:11:33.940
This isn't the world you want, is it?

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:37.050
B- But...

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:40.480
It's all right. There's
nothing to worry about.

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:43.170
I'm with you!

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:52.320
Reiko, I'm home!

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:56.490
Welcome home, dear!

00:11:57.300 --> 00:11:59.030
Time to eat! Feed me!

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:00.570
Coming right up!

00:12:02.010 --> 00:12:05.670
Hey, that's porridge.
I'm not sick.

00:12:06.010 --> 00:12:08.030
Don't say that, dear.

00:12:08.110 --> 00:12:12.550
You're supposed to say,
“I'm sorry to always be such a burden.“

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:16.050
And then I'm supposed to say,
“We promised not to speak about that.“

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:21.610
After that, I'm supposed to make
artificial flowers, paper boxes...

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:24.920
This is true happiness!

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:37.000
I'm hungry, I'm hungry!

00:12:37.070 --> 00:12:40.200
Here's your beef and green peppers!

00:12:40.740 --> 00:12:43.180
Ooh! I've been waiting for this!

00:12:46.350 --> 00:12:47.820
Oops!

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:52.020
Hey, you've got to be
more careful with food.

00:12:52.490 --> 00:12:58.480
It's wrong to waste the life...
...vegetables and animals give for us.

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:01.320
Big brother...

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:06.930
Captain, you said the
same thing as my brother.

00:13:07.000 --> 00:13:09.170
Really? Where's your big brother now?

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:11.210
He died.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.070
Oh.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:18.140
I decided I was going to
marry him when I grew up.

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:20.780
But... But...

00:13:25.220 --> 00:13:29.820
Fei, if you want,
I'll be your big brother.

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:33.790
Okay!

00:13:44.110 --> 00:13:46.100
Why are you following me?

00:13:46.310 --> 00:13:49.970
No reason. We happen to be going
in the same direction, that's all.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:55.340
I'm sorry. I give up.

00:13:55.420 --> 00:13:58.050
I can't get you out of my mind.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:00.850
You probably think
I'm an ugly geek.

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:03.450
No, I don't. See?

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:08.060
I thought so.

00:14:08.130 --> 00:14:09.100
Thought what?

00:14:09.170 --> 00:14:12.360
These glasses are for show.
The lenses are ordinary glass.

00:14:12.440 --> 00:14:13.900
What's wrong with that?

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:17.100
Megumi.

00:14:17.170 --> 00:14:18.770
W- What is it?!

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:22.870
It's a waste to hide such pretty
eyes behind glasses like that.

00:14:23.180 --> 00:14:26.620
That's... my choice.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:30.780
Yes, but I want to gaze into your eyes.

00:14:31.190 --> 00:14:32.660
What?

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.450
I was glad when I met you again.

00:14:37.930 --> 00:14:42.990
You're so pretty and smart, I thought
“ls this really Runny-nosed Rurippe?“

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:47.100
I already know I had a runny
nose, thank you very much.

00:14:47.800 --> 00:14:50.140
I'm sorry. I apologize.

00:14:50.210 --> 00:14:52.610
But I can say now...

00:14:52.680 --> 00:14:56.610
...that you were actually
my first love.

00:14:57.350 --> 00:14:58.840
Huh?

00:14:58.920 --> 00:15:04.320
But I was just a kid, so I made up
that silly lie when we parted...

00:15:05.490 --> 00:15:07.480
I always regretted doing that.

00:15:08.160 --> 00:15:09.680
Ukiya...

00:15:11.630 --> 00:15:15.060
I'm sorry. What the heck am I saying?
There's something wrong with me today.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:19.230
It's your fault.
You're just too pretty.

00:15:23.240 --> 00:15:26.000
I'm sorry. Please forget
what I said a minute ago.

00:15:26.210 --> 00:15:29.940
Wait! I have to tell
you something, too!

00:15:31.250 --> 00:15:33.150
Yes?

00:15:33.220 --> 00:15:36.910
I was happy to meet you again, too!

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:46.490
So fragile... Human
hearts are so fragile!

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:08.140
Your gate power really is
amazing, Rurippe! Incidentally...

00:16:08.820 --> 00:16:12.050
...how did you awaken
your gate power?

00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:15.420
I awakened my gate power...

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:27.040
At Sakaki Animal Hospital

00:16:27.040 --> 00:16:28.060
CLOSED
Please come back tomorrow.

00:16:28.500 --> 00:16:30.840
Th- That can't be!

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:33.870
Somebody! ls anybody here?!

00:16:33.940 --> 00:16:38.240
A kitten has been hit by
a car! Please, help him!!

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:40.140
On your marks!

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.280
What?! I don't believe it!

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:46.720
She got in on a recommendation,
but hasn't had a single victory!

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:49.780
It's hard to believe she's
a sports honor student!

00:16:50.360 --> 00:16:52.790
If it were me,
I'd quit track & field.

00:16:53.560 --> 00:16:55.120
Ready!

00:16:56.830 --> 00:16:58.950
<i>I don't want to lose
to anyone ever again!</i>

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:02.630
<i>I'm going to be in the
Olympics, no matter what.</i>

00:17:05.340 --> 00:17:06.900
<i>0h, no!</i>

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:15.710
You are not very focused today.

00:17:19.120 --> 00:17:23.850
Your mother and father are coming
to your piano recital tomorrow.

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:28.020
<i>That 's right.
I'm going to use my music...</i>

00:17:28.100 --> 00:17:31.560
<i>to make Papa and Mama
be friends again!</i>

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:40.840
Now, walk!

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:44.570
Wait! Where are you taking
my big brother and my grandpa?!

00:17:45.050 --> 00:17:46.610
Shut up!

00:17:50.150 --> 00:17:51.780
Why, you...!

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:54.490
Ukki-yah!

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:03.630
Grampa... Big brother...!

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:11.040
No. You can't.

00:18:12.010 --> 00:18:13.980
Mr. Fukuoka...

00:18:21.050 --> 00:18:22.950
Give up.

00:18:23.220 --> 00:18:25.190
It's useless to try.

00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:31.660
Don't endure the pain.
Let's live here happily ever after.

00:18:32.430 --> 00:18:33.990
Ukiya...

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:39.660
I'll protect Mom and Saemi!

00:18:40.440 --> 00:18:43.000
You're wasting your time.

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:46.340
The future holds nothing but pain.

00:18:46.410 --> 00:18:48.500
It's better to do nothing.

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:51.450
But enough of that. Come on.

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:53.920
Do something more fun with us.

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:56.580
Every action is futile.

00:18:57.420 --> 00:19:00.360
What are you saying?!
That's bullshit!

00:19:00.760 --> 00:19:03.690
All right, I'll show you
the result of your actions.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:08.320
What?!

00:19:09.470 --> 00:19:11.730
The invaders launched an all out attack.

00:19:13.270 --> 00:19:16.070
We fought desperately.

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:19.270
But... but we were totally helpless.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:23.410
Our gate ability is
completely useless.

00:19:24.180 --> 00:19:26.550
It only served to anger the invaders.

00:19:27.580 --> 00:19:31.020
This was all your fault, Captain.

00:19:33.220 --> 00:19:35.850
It can't be. It can't be...

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:49.600
I won't give up. I won't
give up like Dad. Never...

00:19:50.510 --> 00:19:54.770
Hoh, look at him try.
All right, how about this?

00:20:01.520 --> 00:20:03.880
<i>Ukiya, Ukiya...</i>

00:20:11.160 --> 00:20:12.750
Rurippe?

00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:18.060
<i>Ukiya, let 's play!
Let'; p/ay here, forever.</i>

00:20:19.540 --> 00:20:24.370
<i>Let's stop fighting and
be children again. Okay?</i>

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:30.710
Who are you?!

00:20:30.780 --> 00:20:34.740
<i>Who am l? I'm Ruriko.
Your childhood Mano'.</i>

00:20:34.820 --> 00:20:39.310
You are not!! You aren't Rurippe!
Rurippe is... Rurippe is...

00:20:40.690 --> 00:20:43.780
...A RUNNY-NOSED BRAT!!

00:20:44.230 --> 00:20:46.220
Excuse me?!

00:21:05.850 --> 00:21:08.360
What? What's happened?

00:21:11.520 --> 00:21:13.150
Akuma Hakushaku!

00:21:13.320 --> 00:21:15.920
That illusion was your doing?!

00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:22.560
That was no illusion. I merely awakened
the dormant desires within your hearts.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:24.560
Dormant desires...

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:27.240
...within our hearts?

00:21:29.270 --> 00:21:31.140
We shall meet again!

00:21:37.280 --> 00:21:41.050
<i>YS-l7, Captain Ukiya?
Can you hear me?</i>

00:21:47.560 --> 00:21:49.020
Here I come!

00:21:52.560 --> 00:21:55.500
I can't believe the
swimsuits were also an illusion.

00:21:55.560 --> 00:21:58.160
Maybe, but this also serves
to whet the appetite!

00:21:58.930 --> 00:22:01.670
It's okay. After all,
we all wanted to go swimming.

00:22:02.300 --> 00:22:03.930
By the way...

00:22:06.580 --> 00:22:10.270
Who did you mean by
“runny-nosed brat“?

00:22:12.280 --> 00:22:15.250
We all came back to our senses
because of it, so leave it alone!

00:22:16.050 --> 00:22:19.320
Hey-you! Hold it!!

00:22:21.060 --> 00:22:22.720
Somebody, help!!

00:22:22.790 --> 00:22:24.260
Got you!

00:22:24.330 --> 00:22:27.060
I'm Sorryl!

00:22:34.270 --> 00:22:37.970
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:37.970 --> 00:22:41.840
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:41.940 --> 00:22:46.810
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:47.350 --> 00:22:50.190
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:50.190 --> 00:22:52.320
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:52.320 --> 00:22:57.490
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:57.490 --> 00:23:00.830
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:23:00.830 --> 00:23:05.460
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:23:06.170 --> 00:23:10.330
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:23:10.410 --> 00:23:14.970
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:23:15.440 --> 00:23:21.750
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
